{
  "$comment": "Design tokens, frozen in wave 0. Source: docs/spec/04-design.md sections 4.1, 7.1 to 7.6 and 13.1 (values transcribed exactly; PLAN.md overrides where they differ). Generated into src/ui/tokens.css and src/ui/tokens.ts by tools/generate-tokens.ts. Edit this file, then run the generator; never edit the generated files.",
  "version": 1,

  "color": {
